{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 148,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "Praise the LORD! Praise the LORD from the heavens! Praise him in the heights!",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "id": "f1",
            "text": "148:1 Hebrew: יה Yah"
          },
          {
            "id": "f2",
            "text": "148:1 LORD or GOD in all caps is from the Hebrew יהוה Yahweh except when otherwise noted as being from the short form יה Yah."
          }
        ],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你们要赞美耶和华！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你們要讚美耶和華！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "Praise him, all his angels! Praise him, all his army!",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他的众使者都要赞美他！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他的眾使者都要讚美他！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "Praise him, sun and moon! Praise him, all you shining stars!",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "日头月亮，你们要赞美他！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "日頭月亮，你們要讚美他！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "Praise him, you heavens of heavens, you waters that are above the heavens.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "天上的天和天上的水，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "天上的天和天上的水，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "Let them praise the LORD’s name, for he commanded, and they were created.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "愿这些都赞美耶和华的名！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "願這些都讚美耶和華的名！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "He has also established them forever and ever. He has made a decree which will not pass away.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他将这些立定，直到永永远远； 。",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "id": "f1",
            "text": "- 148:6 或译：越过"
          }
        ],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他將這些立定，直到永永遠遠； 。",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "id": "f1",
            "text": "- 148:6 或譯：越過"
          }
        ],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "Praise the LORD from the earth, you great sea creatures, and all depths,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "所有在地上的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "所有在地上的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "8",
      "en": {
        "text": "lightning and hail, snow and clouds, stormy wind, fulfilling his word,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "火与冰雹，雪和雾气，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "火與冰雹，雪和霧氣，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "9",
      "en": {
        "text": "mountains and all hills, fruit trees and all cedars,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "大山和小山，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "大山和小山，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "10",
      "en": {
        "text": "wild animals and all livestock, creatures and flying birds,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "野兽和一切牲畜，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "野獸和一切牲畜，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "11",
      "en": {
        "text": "kings of the earth and all peoples, princes and all judges of the earth,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "世上的君王和万民，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "世上的君王和萬民，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "12",
      "en": {
        "text": "both young men and maidens, old men and children.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "少年人和处女，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "少年人和處女，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "13",
      "en": {
        "text": "Let them praise the LORD’s name, for his name alone is exalted. His glory is above the earth and the heavens.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "愿这些都赞美耶和华的名！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "願這些都讚美耶和華的名！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "14",
      "en": {
        "text": "He has lifted up the horn of his people, the praise of all his saints, of the children of Israel, a people near to him. Praise the LORD!",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "id": "f1",
            "text": "148:14 Hebrew: יה Yah"
          }
        ],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他将他百姓的角高举， 一切圣民人，",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "id": "f1",
            "text": "- 148:14 或译：他使"
          }
        ],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他將他百姓的角高舉， 一切聖民人，",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "id": "f1",
            "text": "- 148:14 或譯：他使"
          }
        ],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}